{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca2da486216934291aaee86f5d9601b8f710ddd5c65511bd1546760678ed450",
      "text": "（…这样下去的话，\n我们的关系是不会改变的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19540632fec9329b9ce69c9a1d3c7d9d110a2403b6a25ee3b789e335e955ad85",
      "text": "（…作家，和影子写手。\n两个人只是在不断地撒谎而已……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1027989f6f521c7f0b4b86b6e5f700019a129fbc0d9d3c843e5547b56413c4a8",
      "text": "…已经，到此为止吧。\n无论是撒谎，还是继续写这样的故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500d27e947b48ea441355f1457b5e00b3a4d39ad411da2d3bce4e9c9556d74b1",
      "text": "…我想作为真正的自己活下去……\n想让大家看到真实的我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe64e7c5d12b5abf3844aa623695baf78219f3b6cbebf49704ec3cd8d5c69cc",
      "text": "（…虽然不知道，该怎么做才好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d326da6436098b9576e5d9c5fa2badffc3ccce4086bf2923c69efb52531e52",
      "text": "（…停下笔的那一刻，\n说不定就会寸步难行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb80ea8a167bd9b0697145bef7d06e12dec30a15b9ec659983c25a60cfea5768",
      "text": "…但是……再这样继续伪装自己下去的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3142b26ca3a8d2a3b26f71081308257c856cb69d321d1cb77fb4aad99d7411a4",
      "text": "再这样隐瞒自己的真实身份下去……\n对任何人都没有好处，我是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1766748cbe589d2610559bba39bffdef402b0d5e524610dc44a509546783590",
      "text": "…是谁？刚才的声音……从电视里传来的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
